WEBVTT

00:07.785 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:49.865 --> 01:50.945
What do you mean?

01:51.025 --> 01:53.385
Thanks for the other night.

01:53.465 --> 01:55.665
I waited in line just to get you
that viral milk tea.

01:55.745 --> 01:56.585
Just showing my respect.

01:57.545 --> 01:59.545
Watch what you say.
People might get the wrong idea.

01:59.625 --> 02:00.705
Let them.

02:00.785 --> 02:03.505
As long as you don't misunderstand
my total devotion to you.

02:03.585 --> 02:04.865
Scram.

02:05.545 --> 02:06.745
Fine, I'll go then.

02:06.825 --> 02:08.545
I just came back to grab my car anyway.

02:08.625 --> 02:10.744
I'll be at the Blue Bay
project site all week.

02:10.825 --> 02:12.145
Don't miss me too much.

02:12.225 --> 02:14.785
You take care of yourself.
You're still heartbroken.

02:14.865 --> 02:17.345
There are cranes
and debris everywhere on site.

02:17.425 --> 02:18.865
Don't get distracted and hurt yourself.

02:19.465 --> 02:21.705
Hearing that actually made me feel better.

02:21.785 --> 02:22.705
You should go.

02:23.665 --> 02:24.705
I'm off.

02:27.145 --> 02:28.745
-Remember to drink it.
-Thanks.

02:44.865 --> 02:45.905
Wanna drink it?

02:47.905 --> 02:49.665
Here. Zhao Heng bought it.
I haven't touched it.

02:54.865 --> 02:56.385
What's wrong?

02:57.025 --> 02:58.985
Nothing. Didn't sleep well last night.

03:00.345 --> 03:01.185
I get it.

03:08.745 --> 03:11.025
So what is going on
with you and Ye Xinzhi?

03:12.385 --> 03:13.465
Nothing.

03:14.225 --> 03:15.385
Don't lie to me.

03:16.545 --> 03:19.185
You definitely told him
you and Yang Rui broke up.

03:19.265 --> 03:20.385
How did he react?

03:22.585 --> 03:24.385
Missy, do you really need to know?

03:25.105 --> 03:27.745
Of course I do. What else would I ask?

03:29.905 --> 03:31.985
-Mr. Pi, I have a meeting soon.
-Well…

03:32.905 --> 03:34.825
I'll send you that file a bit later.

03:39.305 --> 03:40.585
Yang Rui.

03:46.065 --> 03:47.825
Um, let's start the meeting.

04:01.305 --> 04:04.265
During the meeting earlier,
I saw you sitting with Xu Chi.

04:04.345 --> 04:05.825
Why didn't you two have lunch together?

04:07.465 --> 04:09.025
She went to the bank.

04:09.105 --> 04:11.585
Shu told me she's under
a lot of pressure in your team

04:11.665 --> 04:13.305
because you guys
work together too efficiently.

04:13.385 --> 04:14.305
Sometimes, you're like one person.

04:15.425 --> 04:18.345
Just ask what you want to know.
No need to beat around the bush.

04:19.785 --> 04:20.985
You're too guarded with me.

04:21.064 --> 04:22.225
I just want to know

04:22.305 --> 04:23.785
how Xu Chi is doing
since she moved to your team.

04:23.865 --> 04:25.065
She's doing great.

04:25.665 --> 04:27.345
Fully focused on work.
Not missing you at all.

04:30.145 --> 04:31.905
I used to think you two
weren't that close.

04:31.985 --> 04:33.025
Didn't expect you to defend her like that.

04:35.425 --> 04:36.545
We're not close.

04:37.145 --> 04:39.705
So, next time
you have a question like that,

04:39.785 --> 04:40.905
don't bother asking me.

04:42.145 --> 04:44.665
No way. Is this Zhao Heng and Xu Chi?

04:44.745 --> 04:46.625
I just saw it on Moments.

04:46.705 --> 04:49.985
My classmate's bank
had a team dinner last Saturday night.

04:50.065 --> 04:51.225
Such a big scoop.

04:51.305 --> 04:53.625
I had to go gossip right away.

04:53.705 --> 04:56.065
My classmate said
there was even juicier stuff.

04:56.665 --> 04:59.745
Zhao Heng confessed to Xu Chi on the spot!

05:00.905 --> 05:02.985
Wasn't Zhao Heng pursuing Bu Tianna?

05:06.265 --> 05:07.145
What's the gossip?

05:07.745 --> 05:09.185
Share it with me too.

05:09.265 --> 05:10.505
Well.

05:16.025 --> 05:18.025
So juicy.

05:20.385 --> 05:23.065
If you two have
this much time on your hands,

05:23.145 --> 05:25.825
maybe think about
how to get promoted, okay?

05:28.585 --> 05:29.745
Sorry about that.

05:40.305 --> 05:41.625
Have some ice water. Cool down.

05:46.505 --> 05:49.265
Zhao Heng used to drive Xu Chi
to Celestial all the time.

05:49.345 --> 05:50.225
People at Celestial told me.

05:51.065 --> 05:53.305
Back then, Xu Chi
and I were still together,

05:53.385 --> 05:54.825
but she'd rather take Zhao Heng's car.

05:59.545 --> 06:01.385
Seriously, what is wrong with you?

06:01.465 --> 06:03.905
Talking trash about your ex
behind her back? No wonder she dumped you!

06:04.945 --> 06:07.945
Bu Tianna, don't think
you're the only one who gets to be sad.

06:08.025 --> 06:09.625
I got cheated on,

06:09.705 --> 06:11.665
but just because she's your friend,

06:11.745 --> 06:13.425
I'm not even allowed to complain?

06:13.505 --> 06:14.945
My feelings for Xu Chi were real.

06:15.025 --> 06:16.105
Why can't I say it?

06:16.705 --> 06:17.905
Of course you can.

06:17.985 --> 06:20.025
There are plenty of people here.
Say it wherever you want.

06:20.105 --> 06:21.225
Just not in front of me.

06:25.505 --> 06:26.425
Quit staring!

06:28.505 --> 06:29.425
What a temper.

06:39.465 --> 06:42.985
Zhao Heng confessed to Xu Chi on the spot!

06:45.945 --> 06:48.425
Zhao Heng used to drive Xu Chi
to Celestial all the time.

06:48.505 --> 06:49.705
People at Celestial told me.

06:50.305 --> 06:52.545
Back then, Xu Chi
and I were still together.

06:52.625 --> 06:54.225
But she'd rather take Zhao Heng's car.

07:03.385 --> 07:04.385
Wang. Wang.

07:04.465 --> 07:06.145
Is Mr. Zhao from Maxmise with you?

07:07.705 --> 07:09.465
I'm here. What's up?

07:09.545 --> 07:10.665
There's a female colleague
looking for you.

07:10.745 --> 07:12.345
She showed up at the site in all white.

07:12.425 --> 07:14.825
Looked like she was in a rush.
Just grabbed a hard hat and came in.

07:21.545 --> 07:22.825
What are you doing here?

07:28.385 --> 07:29.705
I came to apologize.

07:29.785 --> 07:32.025
Didn't you say you wanted an apology?

07:32.105 --> 07:33.345
I was wrong.

07:33.905 --> 07:34.785
I'm sorry.

07:37.825 --> 07:39.345
I shouldn't have called you shameless.

07:39.425 --> 07:40.945
And I shouldn't have insulted
your parents.

07:41.025 --> 07:43.425
It's all on me. Is this enough?

07:45.385 --> 07:46.465
What do you mean?

07:47.865 --> 07:50.265
Still not enough? Fine.

07:53.785 --> 07:55.865
What I mean is, can we go back

07:55.945 --> 07:57.345
to how things were?

07:57.425 --> 07:59.145
You want to hit on me? I'll play along.

07:59.225 --> 08:01.145
You want to use me as a stepping stone?

08:01.225 --> 08:03.585
I'll play along with that too.
I'll hook you up with connections.

08:03.665 --> 08:05.625
But can you leave Xu Chi alone?

08:05.705 --> 08:06.825
Just come at me.

08:06.905 --> 08:09.105
Don't hurt her to get back at me, okay?

08:09.905 --> 08:11.225
What are you even talking about?

08:11.305 --> 08:12.345
That's still not enough?

08:15.305 --> 08:17.465
Let me tell you,
I don't have that much patience.

08:17.545 --> 08:18.625
Xu Chi is too naive.

08:18.705 --> 08:21.025
She broke up with Yang Rui
for Ye Xinzhi on a whim, and now look.

08:21.105 --> 08:23.745
Ye Xinzhi left her hanging.
She's already a mess.

08:23.825 --> 08:25.545
She can't handle all your sweet talk.

08:25.625 --> 08:27.345
I know exactly
how powerful your tricks are.

08:27.425 --> 08:28.785
You're way too much.

08:28.865 --> 08:30.105
One day you're driving her around.

08:30.185 --> 08:31.585
The next day you're buying
gifts and milk tea.

08:31.665 --> 08:33.705
Then it's all sweet talk.

08:33.784 --> 08:35.024
Isn't it money you're after?

08:35.105 --> 08:37.144
You just want to use her and hurt her!

08:37.225 --> 08:38.825
It's not like that. Calm down.

08:38.904 --> 08:40.385
This is me being calm!

08:40.465 --> 08:42.385
The whole company knows
you two were drinking together.

08:42.465 --> 08:44.465
Even people at Celestial Insurance know.

08:44.545 --> 08:48.385
Zhao Heng, you don't have to go
this far just to get back at me!

09:15.185 --> 09:18.225
What is wrong with you? Are you crazy?

09:22.465 --> 09:24.025
Didn't you tell me to come at you?

09:27.505 --> 09:28.505
Are you calm now?

09:28.585 --> 09:30.025
Can you listen to me now?

09:33.145 --> 09:35.905
I don't know what you heard
or saw out there,

09:35.985 --> 09:37.505
or what you misunderstood.

09:37.585 --> 09:39.505
I just want to say one thing.

09:39.585 --> 09:42.625
Xu Chi and I are just friends.
Like buddies.

09:43.305 --> 09:45.385
I've called her Ms. Xu,
and I've called her Chi.

09:45.465 --> 09:47.225
That Saturday, I was in a bad mood
after arguing with you.

09:47.305 --> 09:49.465
I ran into her at the office.
I asked her to drink with me.

09:50.625 --> 09:51.625
Then I drank too much.

09:51.705 --> 09:53.225
She dumped me in a cab

09:53.305 --> 09:54.345
and sent me home.

09:54.425 --> 09:57.345
Then the next day, I wanted to thank her,
so I bought her a milk tea.

09:57.425 --> 09:59.025
-That's it.
-Really?

10:00.265 --> 10:01.105
Yes.

10:03.665 --> 10:04.825
Then…

10:07.345 --> 10:08.545
Then… I'm fine now.

10:09.145 --> 10:10.185
But I'm not.

10:12.305 --> 10:14.665
I've realized you really get me.

10:16.705 --> 10:18.225
A gorgeous woman standing right here.

10:18.305 --> 10:21.265
She's got money,
a fancy car, and a big house.

10:21.345 --> 10:24.265
You think I'd just change my life goals
over a fight with you?

10:24.345 --> 10:27.025
-Do I look like that kind of guy?
-Okay, okay. I get it.

10:27.905 --> 10:30.545
How can you just take advantage
and walk away?

10:37.185 --> 10:39.065
Hey, aren't you trying to pursue me?

10:39.145 --> 10:41.345
Then you have to get used
to my mood swings

10:41.425 --> 10:42.745
and being used and tossed aside. Got it?

10:45.465 --> 10:46.785
I'm really happy you came to see me today.

11:02.745 --> 11:05.105
God, what a dump this place is.

11:07.865 --> 11:09.105
Tianna!

11:15.305 --> 11:16.625
That was way too short.

11:16.705 --> 11:18.225
Next time, let's make it longer.

11:18.305 --> 11:20.625
And let's try it without the hard hats.

11:40.025 --> 11:41.305
-Hello?
-Where are you?

11:41.385 --> 11:43.265
How come you're not at the office?
And you didn't get back to me on WeChat.

11:43.945 --> 11:44.985
What's wrong?

11:45.065 --> 11:45.865
Something happened
with the Celestial project.

11:45.945 --> 11:48.385
Their board secretary and legal team
just went straight to Mr. Pi.

11:48.465 --> 11:49.665
No idea what they said.

11:49.745 --> 11:51.545
But Mr. Pi came out and announced
the whole project is on hold.

11:53.105 --> 11:55.305
Xu Chi. Xu Chi.

11:55.385 --> 11:57.425
Sha Sha wants you in her office.
Right now.

12:05.465 --> 12:06.825
The recording is standard procedure.

12:06.905 --> 12:08.465
Hope you don't mind.

12:08.985 --> 12:11.265
Also, the Compliance Department will take

12:11.345 --> 12:13.265
your work laptop for the investigation.

12:13.345 --> 12:16.945
Under your contract with the company,
all of this is legal and reasonable.

12:17.025 --> 12:19.145
Investigation? Is something wrong with me?

12:19.745 --> 12:21.545
Everyone on the Celestial project team
is being investigated.

12:21.625 --> 12:22.825
I need to ask you a few questions.

12:24.625 --> 12:26.305
First, why did you apply

12:26.385 --> 12:27.985
to transfer out of
the Celestial project's IT team?

12:29.425 --> 12:32.305
Because Yang Rui and I broke up.

12:33.625 --> 12:36.625
We both felt it wasn't appropriate
to stay in the same team.

12:36.705 --> 12:39.665
-But he's the team lead, so I…
-Why did you two break up?

12:39.745 --> 12:42.305
Why did you fight before the breakup?

12:45.625 --> 12:48.025
These all touch on private matters.
You don't have to answer.

12:48.105 --> 12:49.665
But that could very likely

12:49.745 --> 12:52.105
affect how the company
views this situation.

12:52.705 --> 12:54.745
We just weren't compatible. No fights.

12:55.345 --> 12:57.425
Actually, we weren't together that long.

12:57.505 --> 13:00.345
Once we realized it wasn't working,
we talked it out pretty quickly.

13:00.425 --> 13:01.385
Okay.

13:01.945 --> 13:04.425
Was the detailed reform plan

13:04.505 --> 13:06.625
for Celestial's IT Department done by you?

13:06.705 --> 13:07.745
The draft was.

13:07.825 --> 13:10.345
About 60% of the work.

13:10.425 --> 13:12.105
The other 40% was done by Yang Rui.

13:15.745 --> 13:16.985
Is there something wrong with that plan?

13:20.025 --> 13:22.265
Highlight everything you worked on.

13:22.345 --> 13:23.425
Try to recall as thoroughly as you can

13:23.505 --> 13:26.185
because this will be cross-checked

13:26.265 --> 13:28.185
against your emails
and the investigation results

13:28.265 --> 13:29.505
on Yang Rui.

13:40.385 --> 13:42.545
Also, you need to specify how many times

13:42.625 --> 13:44.945
you met with Mr. Sun

13:45.465 --> 13:47.185
and what you discussed.

14:24.545 --> 14:25.425
Meet me on the rooftop.

14:27.225 --> 14:28.305
Did they call you in?

14:29.665 --> 14:30.865
Talked for ten minutes.

14:30.945 --> 14:32.185
Lu Le talked to me.

14:32.785 --> 14:35.985
She just asked about
your general work situation in our team.

14:36.065 --> 14:39.065
When you didn't come out for so long,
I figured something went wrong.

14:39.145 --> 14:40.385
So I asked around

14:40.465 --> 14:42.985
with people at Celestial
and some of my elders,

14:43.065 --> 14:45.625
-and I put together a rough theory.
-What is it?

14:47.705 --> 14:49.225
MA KE might have made a shady deal

14:49.305 --> 14:51.425
with Director Peng
from Celestial's IT Department.

14:52.185 --> 14:54.385
The plan we made changed

14:54.465 --> 14:56.225
the system architecture
for Celestial's IT Department,

14:56.305 --> 14:57.465
but their IT Department

14:57.545 --> 14:59.745
doesn't have the ability
to do it on their own.

14:59.825 --> 15:00.665
They'd have to outsource.

15:01.265 --> 15:02.985
And that outsourcing
is tied to Director Peng.

15:04.105 --> 15:06.105
But the one who talked to me
and Yang Rui that day was Mr. Sun.

15:06.185 --> 15:09.505
Mr. Sun is the Deputy Director.
Director Peng is the one in charge.

15:09.585 --> 15:12.185
That day, Director Peng
had a last-minute business trip,

15:12.265 --> 15:13.585
so Mr. Sun filled in for him.

15:14.545 --> 15:15.705
Our SOA works perfectly fine,

15:15.785 --> 15:17.585
and you want us
to just switch to microservices?

15:17.665 --> 15:18.505
And get it done in three months?

15:18.585 --> 15:20.065
Do you have any idea
how much work that is?

15:20.145 --> 15:21.705
This transformation has to happen.

15:21.785 --> 15:22.785
So please make sure

15:22.865 --> 15:24.785
to fully cooperate with us
on the redevelopment.

15:24.865 --> 15:26.585
Ma Ke said to put it on hold.

15:26.665 --> 15:27.745
He'll handle it.

15:27.825 --> 15:29.665
Can you not go off on your own like this?

15:29.745 --> 15:31.225
-Yang Rui?
-You figured it out too?

15:36.505 --> 15:37.345
Be honest with me.

15:37.425 --> 15:39.625
Were you involved in this?
How much do you know?

15:40.225 --> 15:42.305
-I don't know anything.
-It's not too late if you tell me now.

15:42.385 --> 15:44.185
Even if I have to beg my dad,

15:44.265 --> 15:45.385
I'd know

15:45.465 --> 15:46.625
how to get you out.

15:46.705 --> 15:48.705
How could I possibly
do something like that?

15:48.785 --> 15:50.985
Ye Xinzhi drilled it into me
so many times.

15:51.065 --> 15:52.345
No conflicts of interest. No kickbacks.

15:52.425 --> 15:53.905
That's the most basic code
of conduct for consultants.

15:53.985 --> 15:55.505
I could never do something like that.

15:59.425 --> 16:00.585
Good.

16:00.665 --> 16:02.185
I heard Mr. Sun kicked up a fuss

16:02.265 --> 16:05.305
because your team's project
was way too ridiculous.

16:05.385 --> 16:06.665
Higher-ups just wanted
to calm things down,

16:06.745 --> 16:07.785
so they had
the Integrity &amp; Compliance Department

16:07.865 --> 16:09.065
go through the motions.

16:09.145 --> 16:10.825
But after just two days,

16:10.905 --> 16:12.985
they found the problem
between Ma Ke and Director Peng.

16:13.985 --> 16:15.745
No wonder Yang Rui
told me to keep quiet during the pitch,

16:16.625 --> 16:17.665
acted so pushy

16:17.745 --> 16:19.785
when presenting the plan,
and set such a tight deadline.

16:20.385 --> 16:21.345
By the way,

16:21.425 --> 16:22.865
Mr. Sun didn't agree back then.

16:22.945 --> 16:23.985
And Ma Ke called Yang Rui,

16:24.065 --> 16:25.865
told me to stay out of it,
and said he'd handle it.

16:27.465 --> 16:28.945
Let me be blunt.

16:29.865 --> 16:32.825
Yang Rui broke up with you so early.
Didn't that

16:33.985 --> 16:35.425
raise any flags?

16:36.065 --> 16:37.905
He must've known that after you broke up,

16:37.985 --> 16:39.665
you wouldn't be on the same team anymore.

16:42.945 --> 16:44.265
Because I thought

16:44.345 --> 16:46.465
the IT architecture overhaul plan
was way too ridiculous.

16:46.545 --> 16:48.025
I sided with Mr. Sun.

16:48.625 --> 16:49.745
So they felt I was in the way.

16:51.465 --> 16:53.265
Yang Rui is Ma Ke's right-hand man.

16:53.905 --> 16:55.665
You're the one who told me that.

16:57.705 --> 16:59.025
No way.

16:59.105 --> 17:00.945
Yang Rui can't be that kind of person.

17:03.425 --> 17:05.944
This kind of thing happens.
I've been through it too.

17:06.025 --> 17:07.785
That's just how Ma Ke is.

17:07.865 --> 17:09.505
He used to be pretty good at his job.

17:09.585 --> 17:11.585
But over the last couple of years,
with more going on at home,

17:11.665 --> 17:13.184
his focus hasn't been on work.

17:13.265 --> 17:15.184
He often takes credit for our work.

17:15.785 --> 17:17.145
But he's good at networking.

17:17.224 --> 17:20.704
Most of Celestial Insurance's projects
came from him drinking with clients.

17:21.704 --> 17:24.105
Wait. Yang Rui told me

17:24.184 --> 17:25.704
Ma Ke's been short on money
these past few years.

17:25.785 --> 17:27.985
That's why he drank himself sick
to land the Celestial deal.

17:28.585 --> 17:29.585
So…

17:30.185 --> 17:31.625
I'll go clear the air with Sha Sha.

17:31.705 --> 17:32.905
Wait.

17:32.985 --> 17:34.105
Okay, alright.

17:35.985 --> 17:38.585
Calm down. Don't do anything right now.

17:39.345 --> 17:41.865
Plus, this is a joint investigation
by Celestial and Maxmise.

17:41.945 --> 17:43.945
Both are top-tier companies.
You won't be wrongly accused.

17:44.625 --> 17:46.345
But I saw the news before.

17:46.425 --> 17:47.985
In 2014, Anxinda had a similar case.

17:48.065 --> 17:50.105
Several people ended up
criminally detained.

17:50.185 --> 17:51.105
Do you think Yang Rui…

17:51.185 --> 17:53.505
Okay, forget about him.

17:53.585 --> 17:55.225
All that matters is that you're okay.

17:55.305 --> 17:57.185
Mr. Pi and Sha Sha
both thought highly of you before.

17:57.265 --> 18:00.305
Once they confirm
you had nothing to do with this,

18:00.385 --> 18:01.585
they'll definitely protect you.

18:01.665 --> 18:04.465
But this has gotten so big.

18:04.545 --> 18:06.945
And insurance is the most
sensitive sector in finance.

18:07.785 --> 18:09.425
If they can't get to the bottom of it,
will they sacrifice the innocent

18:09.505 --> 18:11.305
to protect their reputation?

18:11.385 --> 18:12.585
I'm just a junior analyst.

18:12.665 --> 18:15.545
To them, I'm not irreplaceable.

18:29.225 --> 18:31.345
BUSINESS NEEDS ASSESSMENT PHASE
APRIL 6–8

18:31.425 --> 18:35.065
CELESTIAL INSURANCE

19:46.625 --> 19:49.105
I think Xu Chi's proposal is clean.

19:57.705 --> 20:00.945
I hope you understand how serious this is.

20:02.145 --> 20:05.025
Celestial is getting ready
to bring in economic crimes investigators.

20:05.945 --> 20:07.025
I have a clear conscience.

20:07.105 --> 20:08.625
I'll fully cooperate
with any investigation.

20:10.025 --> 20:11.665
Investigations take time.

20:11.745 --> 20:14.025
So the company wants you
to cooperate with an off-site audit.

20:14.625 --> 20:15.825
What does that mean?

20:16.345 --> 20:17.185
Am I getting fired?

20:17.265 --> 20:18.945
No, just off-site.

20:19.545 --> 20:21.705
To make sure the investigation
isn't interfered with,

20:21.785 --> 20:23.545
you'll need to take a temporary leave.

20:24.145 --> 20:25.745
If you're proven innocent,

20:25.825 --> 20:26.945
you'll come back to work.

20:30.065 --> 20:31.585
Besides me,

20:31.665 --> 20:33.025
will there be anyone else
on leave for the audit?

20:33.705 --> 20:35.625
Yang Rui, Ma Ke, and me.

20:37.145 --> 20:41.265
Because you were suddenly brought in by me

20:41.345 --> 20:42.865
long after the project started.

20:42.945 --> 20:44.145
That doesn't make sense.

20:47.585 --> 20:48.745
Sorry I dragged you into this.

20:50.985 --> 20:52.145
Then…

20:53.105 --> 20:55.985
How long will I be on leave?

20:56.585 --> 20:57.385
About a month for now.

20:58.305 --> 21:00.905
People from Integrity &amp; Compliance
are already waiting for you at your desk.

21:01.505 --> 21:03.385
After you finish with them,
you'd better leave the office right away.

21:04.265 --> 21:05.105
Don't worry.

21:05.185 --> 21:07.785
During the audit, your salary
and benefits won't be affected.

21:10.425 --> 21:11.385
Okay.

21:21.905 --> 21:23.705
Ms. Sha, do you believe me?

21:26.505 --> 21:27.705
I only believe in facts.

21:42.345 --> 21:43.385
-How did it go?
-How did it go?

21:50.185 --> 21:52.505
I'm on immediate leave. Off-site audit.

21:57.505 --> 21:58.745
Even Sha Sha got dragged

22:00.305 --> 22:01.345
into this because of me.

22:01.945 --> 22:02.985
It's fine.

22:03.585 --> 22:04.545
Listen.

22:05.065 --> 22:07.425
Just take your leave.
I'll keep an eye on things here.

22:08.025 --> 22:09.145
I won't let you get screwed over.

22:09.225 --> 22:11.505
So even you think I'm doomed now?

22:13.305 --> 22:16.305
No. It's alright. Don't overthink it.

22:23.985 --> 22:24.825
And your badge.

22:25.505 --> 22:28.185
-Can she come back?
-God knows.

22:30.345 --> 22:32.265
I used to be jealous of her.

22:32.345 --> 22:34.785
After all, she got promoted
the fastest out of all of us.

22:35.505 --> 22:36.345
And now…

23:00.825 --> 23:01.865
What are you…?

23:02.945 --> 23:03.905
Lin, you're back at work.

23:07.025 --> 23:08.065
Welcome back.

23:16.945 --> 23:18.305
Just stay put at the office for now.

23:18.385 --> 23:19.465
I'll go.

23:28.545 --> 23:29.505
Chi.

23:30.345 --> 23:32.545
Come grace my crappy car
with your presence.

23:35.225 --> 23:36.185
Let's go.

23:53.385 --> 23:55.505
Hey, stop being upset.

23:55.585 --> 23:57.425
If it were me, I'd be over the moon.

23:57.505 --> 23:58.905
Come on, paid leave.

23:58.985 --> 24:01.745
A once-in-a-lifetime chance.
Make the most of it.

24:01.825 --> 24:03.545
When you make partner someday,

24:03.625 --> 24:05.065
you can brag to your team

24:05.145 --> 24:07.225
about this rare break.

24:09.745 --> 24:11.465
You don't need to comfort me.

24:11.545 --> 24:12.585
I can handle it.

24:13.265 --> 24:16.025
It's not that far anyway.
You really didn't have to drive me.

24:16.865 --> 24:18.465
It's not just for you.

24:19.665 --> 24:22.385
Tianna will be glad to hear about this.

24:24.785 --> 24:26.745
I just saw you two whispering together.

24:26.825 --> 24:28.265
Didn't look like fighting at all.

24:28.345 --> 24:29.185
Come clean.

24:29.265 --> 24:31.745
What happened when I wasn't around?

24:33.145 --> 24:34.265
Nothing.

24:34.985 --> 24:37.505
Anyway, thanks.

24:37.585 --> 24:38.625
You're thanking me?

24:39.545 --> 24:41.265
You remember that night
I got drunk, right?

24:41.345 --> 24:42.305
You put me in a cab.

24:43.385 --> 24:44.825
Someone took a photo.

24:44.905 --> 24:47.065
Tianna saw it, and immediately drove

24:47.145 --> 24:49.305
to the construction site
in her all-white outfit.

24:49.385 --> 24:51.665
She grilled me.
"Why did you make a move on her?"

24:52.265 --> 24:54.865
She told me to stop messing with you
and to come at her instead.

24:56.345 --> 24:57.705
So you two are the real couple,

24:57.785 --> 24:59.785
and I'm just some cheap side piece?

25:02.145 --> 25:02.985
Glad you know.

25:04.905 --> 25:06.305
Hey, what are you talking about?

25:07.385 --> 25:12.385
What I mean is, she was actually jealous.
She's too stubborn to admit it.

25:12.465 --> 25:15.025
So she used you as her excuse
to come talk to me.

25:15.105 --> 25:17.785
After I explained everything to her,
it was all good.

25:17.865 --> 25:19.065
She was happy.

25:19.145 --> 25:20.265
Even though

25:20.345 --> 25:22.425
I still don't have an official title,
the second you got into trouble,

25:22.505 --> 25:24.505
she called me right away

25:24.585 --> 25:25.825
to figure out what to do.

25:26.865 --> 25:27.945
Got it.

25:28.025 --> 25:30.385
Then keep at it. Make it official soon.

25:31.905 --> 25:33.105
You bet.

25:53.545 --> 25:56.305
I saw you at the café on Saturday.

25:56.385 --> 25:58.545
Can you explain why you were there?

25:58.625 --> 26:00.425
And he was there too.

26:00.505 --> 26:03.385
The two of us were having coffee
and afternoon tea together.

26:04.625 --> 26:10.625
Are you two deeply involved
in our company's business dealings?

26:10.705 --> 26:14.905
Tell me when and where you met Mr. Sun.

26:14.985 --> 26:16.225
The more detailed, the better.

26:16.305 --> 26:17.625
Have you worked together before?

26:17.705 --> 26:20.265
Why does the IT Department
want to replace the entire system?

26:20.345 --> 26:21.865
Give me a proper explanation.

26:21.945 --> 26:23.265
Be honest with me.

26:23.785 --> 26:25.185
Were you involved in this?

26:25.265 --> 26:26.185
How much do you know?

26:26.265 --> 26:27.825
I only believe in facts.

26:28.625 --> 26:30.705
I want to hear your honest answer.

26:31.305 --> 26:32.905
Can you explain why you were there?

26:32.985 --> 26:34.425
Were you involved in this?

26:34.505 --> 26:36.985
Why does the IT Department
want to replace the entire system?

26:37.065 --> 26:38.425
I only believe in facts.

26:38.505 --> 26:40.025
Can you explain why you were there?

26:40.105 --> 26:41.545
Were you involved in this?

26:41.625 --> 26:44.065
Why does the IT Department
want to replace the entire system?

26:44.145 --> 26:45.905
I only believe in facts.

26:50.905 --> 26:53.265
Miss Xu, are you in the room?

26:54.305 --> 26:55.665
Please answer.

26:55.745 --> 26:58.065
Or I'm coming in with the spare key card.

26:59.025 --> 27:01.785
Miss Xu, I'm opening the door!

27:06.825 --> 27:07.785
No, no…

27:13.145 --> 27:14.145
Are you okay?

27:20.505 --> 27:21.905
Thanks. I'll take it from here.

27:21.985 --> 27:23.945
Could you grab me two sports drinks?

27:24.025 --> 27:26.465
-Sure.
-No, no need. I don't need to drink. I…

27:26.545 --> 27:27.665
Don't talk for now.

27:35.745 --> 27:36.825
Eat this.

27:38.625 --> 27:40.105
I'm really fine. I'm not hungry.

27:40.865 --> 27:42.065
Take it.

27:44.225 --> 27:46.905
The front desk said
you haven't left your room in 48 hours.

27:46.985 --> 27:47.865
What have you eaten?

27:51.145 --> 27:52.145
I…

27:54.865 --> 27:56.545
I've just been sleeping.

27:57.145 --> 27:58.185
Look at yourself.

27:58.265 --> 27:59.785
You say you've been sleeping?

27:59.865 --> 28:01.385
Are you lying to me or yourself?

28:08.665 --> 28:10.585
You know about the Celestial thing?

28:12.425 --> 28:13.705
The consulting world is small.

28:14.225 --> 28:16.305
The moment I heard it, I called Sha Sha.

28:16.385 --> 28:18.465
And you? Gone MIA again.

28:18.545 --> 28:21.025
Not replying to WeChat. Phone off.

28:21.825 --> 28:24.705
I dropped everything
and flew back from Shanghai overnight.

28:24.785 --> 28:27.145
Then we hit a thunderstorm
and had an emergency landing in Jinan.

28:27.225 --> 28:29.065
I took the 7 a.m. high-speed train
to get here.

28:29.145 --> 28:30.145
I was worried about you.

28:30.745 --> 28:32.225
You came back just for me?

28:32.305 --> 28:35.185
Of course.
I didn't even drop my luggage off at home.

28:47.825 --> 28:48.985
Go ahead.

28:50.305 --> 28:52.945
Whether you want to chew me out
or laugh at me, I'm ready.

28:53.745 --> 28:54.585
Why would I laugh at you?

28:57.265 --> 28:58.385
Because I'm stupid.

28:58.985 --> 29:01.105
To bury a secret thought
I couldn't share with anyone,

29:01.185 --> 29:02.625
I randomly got a boyfriend.

29:02.705 --> 29:05.025
Then randomly broke up
and got dragged into this.

29:05.665 --> 29:07.465
Now I might even lose my job.

29:08.745 --> 29:09.985
My mom's old apartment

29:10.585 --> 29:13.865
and my big career dreams
could all be down the drain.

29:17.425 --> 29:19.145
You said you wouldn't laugh at me.

29:20.625 --> 29:21.865
I'm not laughing at you.

29:23.025 --> 29:25.345
I'm happy about that secret thought

29:25.425 --> 29:27.305
you couldn't share with anyone.

29:28.185 --> 29:30.065
-Stop making assumptions.
-I'm not.

29:36.305 --> 29:39.345
By the way,
did you see all those WeChat messages

29:39.425 --> 29:40.425
I sent you?

29:41.025 --> 29:42.425
Why didn't you reply?

29:42.505 --> 29:43.745
That picture…

29:45.505 --> 29:48.585
I… I didn't know how to reply.

29:49.305 --> 29:51.185
You told me you were
on a business trip somewhere.

29:51.265 --> 29:54.985
Anything I said back
would've felt weird, right?

29:56.505 --> 29:58.265
Not those. I mean the picture.

29:58.905 --> 29:59.745
What about it?

30:00.545 --> 30:01.865
You… Look again.

30:03.985 --> 30:05.905
Seriously. Just look.

30:14.305 --> 30:15.705
"The moonlight is beautiful tonight."

30:15.785 --> 30:16.865
What about it?

30:21.185 --> 30:22.385
You don't get it?

30:23.145 --> 30:24.265
-What…
-What am I

30:24.345 --> 30:25.785
supposed to get?

30:25.865 --> 30:28.665
Wait… I… I specifically
picked that one. You…

30:30.425 --> 30:33.665
I specially picked that one.
I figured young people would get it.

30:40.665 --> 30:42.425
People online say
"The moonlight is beautiful tonight"

30:42.505 --> 30:44.025
is another way of saying "I love you."

30:55.065 --> 30:56.345
Is that okay?

30:58.825 --> 31:01.865
THE MOONLIGHT IS BEAUTIFUL TONIGHT

31:10.825 --> 31:12.025
And the breeze is gentle.

31:15.505 --> 31:16.985
I wanted to take it slow.

31:18.145 --> 31:19.305
But

31:19.865 --> 31:21.385
I'm scared to let go now.

31:21.465 --> 31:23.065
Because once I do…

31:33.225 --> 31:35.825
So, are we still stuck
in the grey between black and white?

31:38.985 --> 31:40.025
It's red.

31:42.025 --> 31:43.145
The red of my heart racing for you.

32:14.385 --> 32:15.385
DU

32:25.145 --> 32:28.145
Oh no. I've got a meeting with Du soon.

32:28.225 --> 32:29.665
-I gotta go.
-Go ahead.

32:29.745 --> 32:32.305
Why don't you come help me out?

32:32.385 --> 32:33.385
You're on leave anyway.

32:33.465 --> 32:35.505
The project with Wen Ruosen
is wrapping up.

32:36.025 --> 32:37.985
With you there, it'd be easier on me.

32:41.385 --> 32:43.265
Is that okay with my situation?

32:44.385 --> 32:45.665
Should be fine.

32:46.185 --> 32:49.225
Besides, doing a little private work
for your boyfriend…

33:00.825 --> 33:01.865
What did you say?

33:03.985 --> 33:05.265
I said

33:06.105 --> 33:07.865
you're on leave anyway.

33:08.825 --> 33:11.665
Doing a little private work
for your boyfriend should be fine.

33:13.305 --> 33:15.865
If you're really worried,
you can go ask Sha Sha.

33:16.465 --> 33:19.265
Get some rest for now.
See you at the apartment at eight tonight.

33:21.585 --> 33:22.545
I'm heading out.

33:28.385 --> 33:29.505
Wait.

33:41.785 --> 33:42.945
You…

33:44.305 --> 33:46.545
You didn't suddenly say all this

33:47.745 --> 33:48.905
just to comfort me, did you?

33:50.385 --> 33:51.225
Do I look like that kind of guy?

33:58.985 --> 34:00.265
I always thought

34:01.305 --> 34:03.265
a mature guy like you

34:04.105 --> 34:05.705
wouldn't go for a kid like me.

34:10.105 --> 34:12.625
I kept saying

34:13.545 --> 34:15.105
we were just master and protege.

34:15.945 --> 34:18.705
Because I was terrified
you'd look down on my past.

34:20.905 --> 34:23.065
Because love makes people insecure.

34:24.304 --> 34:25.145
It makes me a coward.

34:34.145 --> 34:35.985
I've got plenty of courage.
Let me share some with you.

34:39.025 --> 34:41.505
Okay. Go to your meeting. Careful.

34:55.784 --> 34:57.745
The moonlight is beautiful tonight!

35:00.745 --> 35:01.985
And the breeze is gentle.

35:07.065 --> 35:09.225
DELIVERIES, PLEASE LEAVE AT DOOR
TABLE ON THE LEFT

35:18.145 --> 35:19.825
NO ONE APPLAUDS

35:19.905 --> 35:22.265
Our project has already entered
the delivery phase.

35:22.345 --> 35:23.905
The highlight of this week's delivery

35:23.985 --> 35:25.585
is the overseas business matrix system

35:25.665 --> 35:27.065
we designed for Bolo Culture.

35:27.825 --> 35:28.985
Lin Long is the expert on this.

35:29.585 --> 35:31.185
For the next two days,

35:31.265 --> 35:32.305
she'll be conducting

35:32.385 --> 35:34.785
an overseas business management training
for the executive team.

35:39.505 --> 35:41.505
We meet again, everyone.

35:44.745 --> 35:46.585
BOLO CULTURE OVERSEAS
BUSINESS MATRIX SYSTEM

36:11.025 --> 36:12.385
What a coincidence.

36:12.465 --> 36:15.385
It was Ms. Lin last time too,
and everything went wrong then too.

36:15.465 --> 36:16.945
Think she'll pull it off this time?

36:17.025 --> 36:18.625
I don't know if she's up for it,

36:18.705 --> 36:21.825
but she's been at it forever
and can't even get the screen to work.

36:21.905 --> 36:23.465
If it were me,
I'd have fired her ages ago.

36:25.625 --> 36:27.185
If you're gonna gossip,
at least keep it down.

36:27.265 --> 36:29.185
-Yes.
-Aren't you afraid of being overheard?

36:30.265 --> 36:31.585
Let me tell you,

36:31.665 --> 36:33.305
there are plenty
of Maxmise people here now.

36:33.385 --> 36:34.985
They bill by the hour.

36:35.065 --> 36:36.985
If they hear you and get pissed off

36:37.065 --> 36:38.505
and drag things out
an hour or two every day,

36:38.585 --> 36:39.945
who's paying for that?

36:44.385 --> 36:46.465
Your snack? I'll buy you a new pack.

36:47.665 --> 36:49.825
-Alright. Finish up and get back.
-Okay.

36:52.665 --> 36:53.505
I'll buy you a new pack.

36:54.345 --> 36:55.465
BOLO CULTURE OVERSEAS
BUSINESS MATRIX SYSTEM

36:55.545 --> 36:56.625
Finally.

36:56.705 --> 36:58.625
I'll go tell them
to come in for the meeting.

36:58.705 --> 37:01.305
Sit down and rest.
I'll have Ou Lizheng get them for you.

37:01.385 --> 37:02.745
No need to help me. I can do it myself.

37:02.825 --> 37:04.025
I'm not trying to help you.

37:04.785 --> 37:07.225
I just need you at your best,
so you don't embarrass me.

37:08.025 --> 37:09.985
You know what?
I asked to have you assigned to me

37:10.065 --> 37:11.025
when you came back.

37:11.705 --> 37:12.705
I just wanted to see

37:12.785 --> 37:15.105
how thrilling it feels
to have my old rival

37:15.185 --> 37:16.025
working under me.

37:17.505 --> 37:18.385
Not as thrilling

37:18.465 --> 37:20.345
as the feeling of kicking
my ex-husband to the curb.

37:21.345 --> 37:22.705
Not bad. You've got some fight.

37:22.785 --> 37:23.785
You know what?

37:23.865 --> 37:26.025
These past few months
have been pretty lonely

37:26.105 --> 37:27.185
without anyone giving me pushback.

37:32.425 --> 37:35.065
-What?
-I want to thank you.

37:35.145 --> 37:36.825
Thank you for letting me
back on this project.

37:38.225 --> 37:39.785
Cut it out.

37:39.865 --> 37:42.265
The guys at the office
are just waiting for you to fail.

37:42.345 --> 37:44.265
I'm not letting them steal
my exclusive rights.

37:45.025 --> 37:47.865
You've got half an hour.
I'll hold down the fort for you.

37:51.945 --> 37:52.945
Go touch up your lipstick.

38:21.745 --> 38:24.105
Why did you bring
so much makeup to work here?

38:24.185 --> 38:26.265
You look the same with or without it.

38:26.345 --> 38:27.185
Why are you sneaking up
on people like that?

38:27.265 --> 38:28.505
I was just…

38:32.145 --> 38:34.465
Are you fully recovered?
What's the rush to get back to work?

38:35.465 --> 38:37.665
Thanks for your concern, Mr. Shen.
I've been fine for a while now.

38:39.065 --> 38:40.465
Who are you kidding?

38:40.545 --> 38:41.865
Look at you.

38:41.945 --> 38:43.225
You're thin as a rail.

38:43.985 --> 38:44.905
Want some spicy strips?

38:46.225 --> 38:48.425
-Mr. Shen, let's just go to the meeting--
-Hold on.

38:49.185 --> 38:50.505
I'm the client.

38:50.585 --> 38:53.545
I'm paying you for consulting.
I'm not in a rush, so why are you?

38:55.225 --> 38:56.385
I just wanted to say,

38:56.465 --> 38:58.825
if you haven't fully recovered,
don't rush back to work.

38:59.625 --> 39:00.905
Why push yourself?

39:00.985 --> 39:03.025
Just wing it during the training later.

39:03.785 --> 39:05.185
Just send us the slides afterward.

39:06.705 --> 39:08.225
Mr. Shen, do you think

39:08.305 --> 39:10.425
I've been coasting in consulting

39:10.505 --> 39:12.025
all these years?

39:12.105 --> 39:14.025
I'll admit I wasn't
professional enough before.

39:14.105 --> 39:16.945
That's because my hormones
were out of whack during pregnancy.

39:17.025 --> 39:18.225
But now that I'm back,

39:18.305 --> 39:19.585
I'm going to do it right.

39:20.385 --> 39:24.025
I was just expressing my concern for you.

39:24.825 --> 39:26.745
Purely out of sympathy.

39:26.825 --> 39:27.825
Sympathy?

39:27.905 --> 39:30.545
When you fail, do you want people
to comfort you with sympathy?

39:32.505 --> 39:33.785
What's wrong with you?

39:34.425 --> 39:36.225
I try to be nice,
and you throw it back in my face.

39:46.945 --> 39:48.945
-What?
-I wanted to thank you

39:49.025 --> 39:51.785
for taking me to the clinic
after my car accident

39:51.865 --> 39:53.145
and for

39:53.225 --> 39:55.185
checking on me just now.

39:56.785 --> 39:57.625
And this.

39:59.705 --> 40:01.105
Xu Chi brought this to me before.

40:01.705 --> 40:03.665
She said you specifically asked for it.
And she passed along that message.

40:04.705 --> 40:06.665
"A rebirth through hardship
and better days ahead."

40:06.745 --> 40:08.465
I've had my share of hardship.

40:08.545 --> 40:09.985
Now it's time to earn those better days

40:10.065 --> 40:11.705
with my own two hands.

40:15.745 --> 40:17.385
Just keep it. No need to give it back.

40:18.985 --> 40:21.785
Then I'll just sit back
and watch you do your thing.

40:22.745 --> 40:24.225
But let's get one thing straight.

40:24.305 --> 40:26.065
If you don't do a good job,

40:26.145 --> 40:27.985
I'll still have your company replace you.

40:29.225 --> 40:31.025
-No problem.
-Alright.

40:31.785 --> 40:32.665
Get back in there.

40:37.825 --> 40:39.025
Wait.

40:41.065 --> 40:42.305
Let me make one thing clear.

40:42.985 --> 40:44.585
I didn't specifically
get that thing for you.

40:45.185 --> 40:46.665
Everyone in our company has one.

40:48.105 --> 40:48.945
I get it.

40:49.625 --> 40:50.625
And…

40:53.265 --> 40:54.345
I meant what I said.

40:54.425 --> 40:55.905
You look good

40:58.625 --> 40:59.505
with or without makeup.

41:04.585 --> 41:06.945
Our first question
covers three main areas.

41:07.025 --> 41:10.145
Revenue forecast,
cost structure, and break-even.

41:10.225 --> 41:11.185
Everyone can take a look.

41:11.265 --> 41:13.865
Feel free to ask
if you have any questions.

41:14.785 --> 41:16.785
Ms. Lin, based on Maxmise's analysis,

41:16.865 --> 41:18.145
what's the biggest pain point

41:18.225 --> 41:19.865
and challenge in the HR integration

41:19.945 --> 41:21.905
between Bolo and Qingyi?

41:22.985 --> 41:25.025
The biggest challenge is that

41:25.105 --> 41:26.145
getting married is easy,
but living together is hard.

41:26.745 --> 41:28.425
Let me use a familiar romance drama

41:28.505 --> 41:29.585
as an example.

41:29.665 --> 41:31.825
Bolo is like a career-driven CEO

41:31.905 --> 41:33.185
who lives and breathes KPIs.

41:33.265 --> 41:35.825
And Qingyi is like an artistic girl

41:35.905 --> 41:37.305
who meditates for three minutes
before every meeting.

41:37.385 --> 41:39.185
Put two people like that
under the same roof

41:39.265 --> 41:41.425
after marriage, and the trouble starts.

41:42.225 --> 41:43.825
Like, after using the bathroom,

41:43.905 --> 41:45.865
should the toilet seat stay up or down?

41:49.505 --> 41:51.145
Of course, that's just a metaphor.

41:51.225 --> 41:53.945
The book value of a merger
is written in the financials.

41:54.025 --> 41:55.985
But the real value
is hidden in the everyday conversations

41:56.065 --> 41:57.025
between organizations.

41:57.105 --> 41:59.105
Maxmise's job is to help Bolo and Qingyi

41:59.185 --> 42:01.465
find a new organization
despite their differences.

42:03.065 --> 42:04.185
She's good to go.

42:08.305 --> 42:11.665
How are things on the Celestial side?
She was just asking about Xu Chi.

42:13.145 --> 42:14.625
I can go back to work next week.

42:14.705 --> 42:16.025
As for Celestial…

42:17.385 --> 42:19.025
Ma Ke and Celestial's IT director

42:19.105 --> 42:20.625
are still blaming each other.

42:21.385 --> 42:22.905
The investigation
won't wrap up anytime soon.

42:52.785 --> 42:54.105
What?

42:56.985 --> 42:58.785
I…

43:00.145 --> 43:02.345
The painting behind you is really nice.
I just took a photo.

43:14.665 --> 43:15.585
What are you doing?

43:16.865 --> 43:17.985
The flowers behind you are nice too.

43:18.665 --> 43:19.745
I'm taking a photo.

43:23.185 --> 43:24.465
Let me see.

43:25.385 --> 43:26.625
Let me see what you took.

43:28.025 --> 43:29.905
-No!
-It looks great.

43:29.985 --> 43:33.745
No! Send it to me.
My face looks so puffy in this.

43:33.825 --> 43:35.505
Look at mine.
Look at the one I took of you.

43:36.625 --> 43:38.145
Look what I took for you.

43:38.745 --> 43:41.025
You gotta send me that one.
I need to edit it.

43:41.105 --> 43:42.305
You really take good photos.

43:42.385 --> 43:43.625
Okay, I'll send it to you.

43:49.505 --> 43:50.705
Let's get down to business.

43:51.225 --> 43:54.305
You had me gathering market data
on digital collectibles for so long.

43:54.385 --> 43:56.145
What are you planning to do to Wen Ruosen?
